## Positive control

33 variant drawings that Barthel gave for basic signs, fitted with the basic templates: mean coverage 0.44, median 0.42; 9% matched their own sign first; 0% reach the decomposition threshold. This is the ceiling the method can reach on drawings known to be the same sign.

If every decomposing sign were replaced by its parts, the head inventory would fall from 602 to 601 drawn signs, and 5 of 3168 rare tokens would be rewritten with basic signs.

